      "data": "Send what you ask about to Inkling’s AI?\n\nWhen you ask the tutor something, Inkling sends your question and the context you include — an image of your lasso selection, or text from the current page — over an encrypted connection. Nothing is sent until you ask.\n\nYour question and an image of what you selected go to Inkling’s AI server and are answered by Cloudflare Workers AI. Neither keeps your content: Cloudflare says it does not use it to train models or store it after answering, and Inkling’s server never stores or logs it. To share out the free daily allowance, the server counts answers per installation (a random ID this app made) and per internet connection, in scrambled form that is deleted every day.\n\nThe AI is free, with a limited number of answers per day. It never costs anything: when the day’s free answers are used up, the tutor pauses until midnight UTC and your notebooks work as usual. Don’t include sensitive personal information.\n\nRead Cloudflare’s Workers AI data policy. You can withdraw this permission any time in Settings.\n\nNot now\nAllow"
    },
